  "decision_conditions": [
    "Reason : 1 - The London Borough of Hounslow as the Local Planning Authority hereby certify that on 16/04/2025, the proposal as shown on the drawing(s) submitted on 16/04/2025 and numbered 'Location plan (unnumbered), 01, 02,03, 04, 05, 06, application form' was not lawful within the meanings of Section 191 and 192 of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990. The development fails to comply with the terms of Article 3, Schedule 2, Part 1, Class E of the Town and Country Planning (General Permitted Development) (England) Order 2015 (as amended) because the proposed outbuilding would not be incidental to the purpose of the main house as it would include a primary living accommodation by way of a bathroom. "
